  {
    "en": "“Is everyone ready?”",
    "ko_bytes": 32
  },
  {
    "en": "“We've been waiting forever!”",
    "ko_bytes": 29
  },
  {
    "en": "“Yeah!”",
    "ko_bytes": 10
  },
  {
    "en": "“Ready!”",
    "ko_bytes": 19
  },
  {
    "en": "“I'm good to go too.”",
    "ko_bytes": 31
  },
  {
    "en": "“Well then—Let's go!”",
    "ko_bytes": 22
  },
  {
    "en": "“Oh!!!!”",
    "ko_bytes": 13
  },
  {
    "en": "Today, we had plans to visit a tourist destination in the mountains—a hot spring.",
    "ko_bytes": 81
  },
  {
    "en": "Although it's nearby, without any transportation, we have to take a bus to get there.",
    "ko_bytes": 121
  },
  {
    "en": "The journey took nearly an hour, and by the time we arrive, it's almost evening.",
    "ko_bytes": 108
  },
  {
    "en": "“We're here!”",
    "ko_bytes": 25
  },
  {
    "en": "“Hehe, I'm really looking forward to soaking in the hot springs.”",
    "ko_bytes": 59
  },
  {
    "en": "“It's a shame it's not winter. In winter, there's the snow and also the beautiful starry sky. Now that's a real hot spring experience.”",
    "ko_bytes": 150
  },
  {
    "en": "“Having a couple of drinks sounds pretty good too.”",
    "ko_bytes": 49
  },
  {
    "en": "“I don't get what's so great about that...?”",
    "ko_bytes": 66
  },
  {
    "en": "“Sooner or later... you'll be hooked.”",
    "ko_bytes": 37
  },
  {
    "en": "“Um... doubt it.”",
    "ko_bytes": 34
  },
  {
    "en": "“Wow... So many people.”",
    "ko_bytes": 46
  },
  {
    "en": "“Yeah... It feels more like a small festival than a hot spring inn.”",
    "ko_bytes": 85
  },
  {
    "en": "“Guess this won't be as simple as we thought...”",
    "ko_bytes": 75
  },
  {
    "en": "Although the crowd in front of us isn't exactly overwhelming, there's still people coming and going, which is making things quite lively.",
    "ko_bytes": 107
  },
  {
    "en": "“Right? That's why I said there was no need to eat a lot before coming.”",
    "ko_bytes": 78
  },
  {
    "en": "“I always thought it was just a single inn, but it turns out the entire street is like this.”",
    "ko_bytes": 91
  },
  {
    "en": "“Is there a special event tonight or something?”",
    "ko_bytes": 57
  },
  {
    "en": "“No, it's always like this.”",
    "ko_bytes": 48
  },
  {
    "en": "“But the stalls only come out on holidays.”",
    "ko_bytes": 52
  },
  {
    "en": "“It just turned out this way. I remember when I was a kid, there weren't this many inns around here...”",
    "ko_bytes": 115
  },
  {
    "en": "“Ooooo!”",
    "ko_bytes": 17
  },
  {
    "en": "“What?!”",
    "ko_bytes": 24
  },
  {
    "en": "“That... is so cute!”",
    "ko_bytes": 29
  },
  {
    "en": "“Oh—the ring toss game?”",
    "ko_bytes": 46
  },
  {
    "en": "“That stuffed toy... Isn't it from that popular kids cartoon?”",
    "ko_bytes": 87
  },
  {
    "en": "“So what! I like it.”",
    "ko_bytes": 40
  },
  {
    "en": "“The plushie is huge... You definitely have to throw a ton of rings to win it.”",
    "ko_bytes": 106
  },
  {
    "en": "“Looks pretty hard. Wanna give it a try, Shizuku?”",
    "ko_bytes": 64
  },
  {
    "en": "“Um... wouldn't it be more cost-effective to just buy one?”",
    "ko_bytes": 65
  },
  {
    "en": "“After all, the fun is in the process.”",
    "ko_bytes": 49
  },
  {
    "en": "“Let me do it; I think I can give it a shot.”",
    "ko_bytes": 55
  },
  {
    "en": "“Eh? Can you really?”",
    "ko_bytes": 40
  },
  {
    "en": "“Hehe, I've worked in places like this before, so I know some tricks.”",
    "ko_bytes": 109
  },
  {
    "en": "“Then I'll join too!”",
    "ko_bytes": 27
  },
  {
    "en": "“.........”",
    "ko_bytes": 18
  },
  {
    "en": "“Um, Shizuko, do you want one too?”",
    "ko_bytes": 55
  },
  {
    "en": "“...Oh.”",
    "ko_bytes": 20
  },
  {
    "en": "“I... I'm not particularly interested, but it's okay if you win it.”",
    "ko_bytes": 107
  },
  {
    "en": "“Gotcha. Leave it to me!”",
    "ko_bytes": 53
  },
  {
    "en": "“Hey buddy, lemme give it a go!”",
    "ko_bytes": 44
  },
  {
    "en": "“You got it!”",
    "ko_bytes": 28
