  {
    "en": "“.........”",
    "ko_bytes": 18
  },
  {
    "en": "“This is the latest monster movie plushie. What's special about it is that it has a skeleton, so it looks soft but can be put into highly movable positions!”",
    "ko_bytes": 161
  },
  {
    "en": "BOSS",
    "ko_bytes": 4
  },
  {
    "en": "“Take it. I know you've been watching a lot of sci-fi movies lately, and if it were me, I'd want to collect one too!”",
    "ko_bytes": 116
  },
  {
    "en": "“Well, well. You have great taste, lady. That was supposed to be the grand prize for tonight, but you got it right away!”",
