  },
  {
    "en": "BOSS",
    "ko_bytes": 4
  },
  {
    "en": "“.........”",
    "ko_bytes": 18
  },
  {
    "en": "“By the way, you can put batteries in it. When you squeeze it, it makes a sound.”",
