  },
  {
    "en": "Monster",
    "ko_bytes": 7
  },
  {
    "en": "“...Huh.”",
    "ko_bytes": 17
  },
  {
    "en": "“There's only two rooms left here?”",
    "ko_bytes": 52
  },
  {
    "en": "“Yup. On Sundays, it's usually hard to find vacant rooms without booking ahead of time.”",
    "ko_bytes": 58
  },
  {
    "en": "Man4",
    "ko_bytes": 4
  },
  {
    "en": "“Crap... This is the last inn with two rooms left; the others either have single rooms or are fully booked.”",
    "ko_bytes": 139
  },
  {
    "en": "“So, this is it?”",
    "ko_bytes": 50
  },
  {
    "en": "“But we've got a problem...”",
    "ko_bytes": 31
  },
  {
    "en": "“Who's gonna share a room with {Me}?”",
    "ko_bytes": 48
  },
  {
    "en": "“............”",
    "ko_bytes": 18
  },
  {
    "en": "Kasumi&Ayano&Shizuku&Sizuko",
    "ko_bytes": 27
  },
  {
    "en": "“Well... maybe I can go somewhere else...”",
    "ko_bytes": 56
  },
  {
    "en": "“Shut up!”",
    "ko_bytes": 23
  },
  {
    "en": "“Ah! O-Okay...”",
    "ko_bytes": 24
  },
  {
    "en": "“Looks like we'll have to decide using rock paper scissors.”",
    "ko_bytes": 43
  },
  {
    "en": "“Hmph... We'll see who's the luckiest here.”",
    "ko_bytes": 57
  },
  {
    "en": "“This isn't just luck; it's skill!”",
    "ko_bytes": 46
  },
  {
    "en": "“I'm getting in the hot spring with {Me}!”",
