  {
    "en": "<sprite=4> Shizuko <sprite=5>",
    "ko_bytes": 31
  },
  {
    "en": "“Hehehe...”",
    "ko_bytes": 31
  },
  {
    "en": "“......”",
    "ko_bytes": 18
  },
  {
    "en": "“C'mon then, let's get going, {Me}♡.”",
    "ko_bytes": 35
  },
  {
    "en": "“Oh no...”",
    "ko_bytes": 18
  },
  {
    "en": "“This is not good... She's even more dangerous than Shizuko.”",
    "ko_bytes": 77
  },
  {
    "en": "“W-What's wrong?”",
    "ko_bytes": 22
  },
  {
    "en": "“This is the first time I've seen that expression on Kasumi's face.”",
    "ko_bytes": 65
  },
  {
    "en": "“She looks like she's going to devour him.”",
    "ko_bytes": 51
  },
  {
    "en": "“Terrifying...”",
    "ko_bytes": 21
  },
  {
    "en": "“Wow, it's a nice double room. Pretty spacious.”",
    "ko_bytes": 56
  },
  {
    "en": "“Yeah, and it wasn't expensive for one night. No wonder this place is famous.”",
    "ko_bytes": 138
  },
  {
    "en": "“But is this really okay?”",
    "ko_bytes": 47
  },
  {
    "en": "“I think it would be better if you shared a room with Shizuko?”",
    "ko_bytes": 109
  },
  {
    "en": "“Oh my? Are you saying you'd prefer to soak with Shizuku and Ayano?”",
    "ko_bytes": 77
  },
  {
    "en": "“No, it's not like that—!”",
    "ko_bytes": 53
  },
  {
    "en": "“It's just that both of you enjoy drinking, so you could have a great time together.”",
    "ko_bytes": 109
  },
  {
    "en": "“Sounds appealing.”",
    "ko_bytes": 44
  },
  {
    "en": "“But what do you really think?”",
    "ko_bytes": 44
  },
  {
    "en": "“How could I resist...”",
    "ko_bytes": 50
  },
  {
    "en": "“Hehe... That's the right answer!”",
    "ko_bytes": 27
  },
  {
    "en": "“Um...”",
    "ko_bytes": 18
  },
  {
    "en": "“There's still some time before dinner; shall we go for a soak?”",
    "ko_bytes": 90
  },
  {
    "en": "“After working so hard, it wouldn't be right not to reward ourselves.”",
    "ko_bytes": 103
  },
  {
    "en": "“W-Well, you have a point...”",
    "ko_bytes": 37
  },
  {
    "en": "“Whew...”",
    "ko_bytes": 18
  },
  {
    "en": "I can finally understand why this place is such a popular attraction.",
    "ko_bytes": 62
  },
  {
    "en": "Most of the guest rooms here come with private outdoor hot springs.",
    "ko_bytes": 69
  },
  {
    "en": "The night view from here, accompanied by a glass of wine, is nothing short of spectacular.",
    "ko_bytes": 102
  },
  {
    "en": "No wonder most of the guests outside are couples.",
    "ko_bytes": 57
  },
  {
    "en": "It's practically the perfect place to boost the birth rate...",
    "ko_bytes": 49
  },
  {
    "en": "“Shall we have another glass?”",
    "ko_bytes": 24
  },
  {
    "en": "“Oh... thank you.”",
    "ko_bytes": 29
  },
  {
    "en": "“Well, I guess I'll have another one too; it happens to be the last.”",
    "ko_bytes": 49
  },
  {
    "en": "*gulp*... *glug*...",
    "ko_bytes": 25
  },
  {
    "en": "“Ahhhh...”",
    "ko_bytes": 15
  },
  {
    "en": "“So relaxing...”",
    "ko_bytes": 25
  },
  {
    "en": "“Yeah...”",
    "ko_bytes": 24
  },
  {
    "en": "“I feel all warmed up...”",
    "ko_bytes": 48
  },
  {
    "en": "“That'd be weird if you didn't...”",
    "ko_bytes": 50
  },
  {
    "en": "“Haha... Someone's lively. You're literally floating.”",
    "ko_bytes": 62
  },
  {
    "en": "“Um... it's just because Kasumi is beside me.”",
    "ko_bytes": 75
  },
  {
    "en": "“So... what should we do next? We still have plenty of time.”",
    "ko_bytes": 70
  },
  {
    "en": "“What should we do...?”",
    "ko_bytes": 35
  },
  {
    "en": "“A naked woman is sitting beside you... Isn't there something you want to do?”",
    "ko_bytes": 92
  },
  {
    "en": "“Or are you waiting for me to make the move?”",
    "ko_bytes": 71
  },
  {
    "en": "“......”",
    "ko_bytes": 18
  },
  {
    "en": "“Naughty, naughty boy~”",
    "ko_bytes": 34
  },
  {
    "en": "“Well... I've already gotten in... What do you want to do~♡?”",
    "ko_bytes": 73
  },
  {
    "en": "“Woohoo!”",
    "ko_bytes": 31
  },
  {
    "en": "“Hey!”",
    "ko_bytes": 16
  },
  {
    "en": "“Oh my, what a shame...”",
    "ko_bytes": 36
  },
  {
    "en": "“Brat...”",
    "ko_bytes": 25
  },
  {
    "en": "“Hehe... Well then, bitches, time to enjoy myself~”",
    "ko_bytes": 69
  },
  {
    "en": "“Wait—Ayano?”",
